  triage:title "AG.9 cross-host-findings-ledger.md cites wrong line range for runtime_health.rs Send dispatch arm" ;
  triage:description "AG.9 QA-1 Important finding (req-qa ATM-QA-001): docs/plans/phase-AG/cross-host-findings-ledger.md originally cited crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health.rs:589-596 as the dispatch handling for RequestEnvelope::Send(...), but that range was inside an unrelated poison-recovery closure. The real Send match arm is at lines 608-620. FIXED in integrate/phase-AG: AG-FIND-005 entry now records the correct high-level problem statement without false code citations." ;
